{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1979,
    "dDurationMs": 3331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Welcome to beautiful Vancouver, British Columbia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5310,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is actually where I grew up, just across\nthat water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8430,
    "dDurationMs": 4649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I remember when I was a teenager here\nI wanted to be a film maker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13079,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so what did I do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14379,
    "dDurationMs": 5931,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I found a film director with a strange\nname who lived in Vancouver."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20310,
    "dDurationMs": 5910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I saw her on the cover of this magazine and\nthen I just looked up her number in the phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26220,
    "dDurationMs": 4889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "book, in the white pages, because that is\nhow you did back in the year 2000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31109,
    "dDurationMs": 3331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I gave her a call and she said she was\non the other line, but she would call me back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34440,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, strangely enough, she did call me back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37420,
    "dDurationMs": 1389,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38809,
    "dDurationMs": 3061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got to chat to her about film making."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41870,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess what I really wanted was for someone\nelse to be able to provide me with an opportunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46340,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get on set, to get some experience in that\nindustry and show me what it is like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51680,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just want to know and it is so hard when\nyou are on the outside to figure out how to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56059,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "break in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57059,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just want to reach out to someone who\nknows and say: Help me with this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61420,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a psychological phenomenon known\nas learned helplessness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65680,
    "dDurationMs": 5730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the experiments conducted way back decades\nago that established this phenomenon were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71410,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really quite terrible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73490,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What they would do is take dogs and for some\nof them, at least, they would force them to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76920,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "endure a punishment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78670,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, they would receive electric shocks\nand there was nothing they could do to prevent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82670,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those shocks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83670,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For other dogs there were actually little\nlevers or a fence they could hop over that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87080,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would stop the shocks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88610,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now later on they took all of those dogs and\nthey tested them again, but in environments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92830,
    "dDurationMs": 5630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where every one of those dogs had the opportunity\nto avoid the shocks by taking some action."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98460,
    "dDurationMs": 5030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what was found was those dogs that had\nbeen forced to endure the shocks and had no"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103490,
    "dDurationMs": 5450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way of stopping them just kind of came to\naccept the shocks even when there were actions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108940,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they could take which would stop them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111540,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is learned helplessness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114070,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have learned that there is nothing they\ncan do to stop that uncomfortable situation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119090,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a related study carried out with\nadults where they were trying to complete"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123300,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a task, except there was this distracting\nnoise playing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127000,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now some of the adults had the ability to\nturn off that noise, whereas others did not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131780,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was not under their control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133590,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you look at the performance, the\nadults who had the control to turn off the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137090,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "noise performed better even when they didn’t\nactually exercise that control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141920,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they just let the noise play, but the knowledge\nthat they could shut it off if they wanted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145599,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to, made them perform better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149000,
    "dDurationMs": 5709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have worked at many jobs now, some very\nmenial and some more managerial or entrepreneurial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154709,
    "dDurationMs": 1941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I was basically running the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156650,
    "dDurationMs": 5539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I found is that there is kind of\nthis divide between employees and managers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162189,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you are an employee and you are assigned\nto do something, you try to do it as best"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166079,
    "dDurationMs": 4231,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have been shown, but if you hit a roadblock\nyou kind of stop and you go to your manager"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170310,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or supervisor and you say: Hey, what do I\ndo now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173069,
    "dDurationMs": 1161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have done that before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174230,
    "dDurationMs": 1819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have done it when I was a research assistant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176049,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would get some result."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177049,
    "dDurationMs": 1131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn’t really know what was going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178180,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I would just take it to my supervisor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179340,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The supervisor would say: Oh, well, why don’t\nyou try this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183780,
    "dDurationMs": 5079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that suggestion that they made was always\none that I knew or, you know, I could have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188859,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thought of if I had just spent five minutes\non it or if I really wanted to achieve that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193829,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194829,
    "dDurationMs": 5330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But instead, I just had this mentality like:\nI am carrying out this task and when I get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200159,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stuck, I am just going to ask someone else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201420,
    "dDurationMs": 2189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, there is a story that Tim Ferriss\ntells."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203609,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He is the guy who wrote The Four Hour Work\nWeek which is a book I would recommend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207079,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he went and visited this university and\nhe challenged the students that he was talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212549,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213549,
    "dDurationMs": 5050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said: Look, I will give you 25,000 dollars\nand a trip around the world for anyone who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218599,
    "dDurationMs": 5551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shows that they have made contact, by some\nsort of signature or email, a letter or something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224150,
    "dDurationMs": 5530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with either Jennifer Lopez, Bill Clinton—who\nI think at the time was the President, possibly—and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229680,
    "dDurationMs": 4709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "J.D. Salinger, who is the most reclusive writer\nof all time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234389,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And did anyone do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236450,
    "dDurationMs": 1179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237629,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238959,
    "dDurationMs": 4631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the following year he went back to the\nsame university and in addition to making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243590,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the challenge he told them the story from\nthe previous year, that no one had actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248810,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "done it, no one had really tried."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252310,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that year six people actually achieved\nhis challenge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258090,
    "dDurationMs": 6430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The point being, you need to find a way around\nthe learned helplessness mentality, the employee"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264520,
    "dDurationMs": 6460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mentality and find a way to realize that things\nthat seem impossible can be accomplished if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270980,
    "dDurationMs": 6010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you really accept that you have control of\nthese things, that it is not outside of your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276990,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277990,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It may be a question we should ask is: Does\nour school system promote learned helplessness?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282960,
    "dDurationMs": 6740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do we force kids to suffer punishments that\nthey really can’t change time and time and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289700,
    "dDurationMs": 4870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time again and then we expose them to a world\nand say: Now you go out and do what you want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294570,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295780,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think to a certain degree we are doing that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297770,
    "dDurationMs": 7570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, school is for a lot of kids just\na weird and unusual kind of punishment and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305340,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess it is no wonder that they learn that,\nyou know, there is things beyond their control,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308980,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because school is kind of about taking control\naway from kids."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314340,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, for the dogs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315830,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did they get the dogs to overcome their\nlearned helplessness and actually get away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319930,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the shocks they were receiving?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321750,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They tried treats and encouragements, but\nit didn’t work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325180,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had to physically move the dogs away\nfrom the area where they were being shocked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330090,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least twice before they would actually\nlearn that they had the power to change their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336410,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faith, that they didn’t have to suffer that\nkind of punishment again and again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341750,
    "dDurationMs": 6820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with you, I feel like just letting you\nknow that this thing exists might be enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348570,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to change the way you view your life and your\nopportunities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353590,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let’s talk briefly about career paths."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357890,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I applied to acting school three times and\nwas rejected three times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362250,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I applied to film school twice and was rejected\ntwice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365710,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think what I was looking for out of those\ninstitutions was a sure fire way to get to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370140,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the career that I wanted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371710,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was basically doing the same thing that\nI was doing when I asked that director in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376810,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vancouver to help me out, to get me on set."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379380,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was asking for someone else to make this\npossible for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383040,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, there is a small number of jobs where\nthe career path is clearly laid out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387470,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to be a doctor, you have to go to\nmed school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389270,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to be a lawyer, you have to go to\nlaw school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391440,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to be an academic, you have to do\na PhD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395090,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think there is a much larger group of\ncareers where you really have to figure out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399750,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a way to do it yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is the whole point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404120,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the whole challenge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406260,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You feel like you are not in control and you\nwant someone else to help you get that control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411470,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or get in the place where you need to be,\nbut no one can really help you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415820,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like that director couldn’t really\nhelp me get where I need to be, I cannot help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other people get where they need to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421440,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really have it all up to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425360,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you have to demonstrate that you can\ndo what you want to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430850,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, there is this quote."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433320,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Grant me the serenity to accept the things\nI cannot change and the courage to change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438010,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the things I can and the wisdom to know the\ndifference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442200,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now my point is: When you are contemplating\nthe things that you can and cannot change,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447090,
    "dDurationMs": 9790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ere on the side of thinking that you can change\nmuch more than you can, because often you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456880,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be able to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458970,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, everything seems impossible until\nit is done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463620,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a Nelson Mandela quote, which I think\nis kind of appropriate in this circumstance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469380,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things look a lot more impossible than they\nare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472350,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, really, it is up to you to find out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479990,
    "dDurationMs": 8760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, as you can tell, books have had a huge\nimpact on my life and how I see the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488750,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when I am traveling I like to listen to\nthem as audio books, because it is just more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491940,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "convenient on planes and trains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is actually one I wanted to recommend\nto you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495760,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called Predictably Irrational by Dan\nAriely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499410,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is about how humans don’t really behave\nrationally even when we think that is what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503700,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we are doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504700,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it provides pretty good insight into how\nyour brain works and how the brains of everyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508410,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around you work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509460,
    "dDurationMs": 4119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want, you can download this book\nfor free by going to Audible.com/Veritasium"
